<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle trade not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle trade not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive early Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. The last established price was $64.00 per cwt on Friday. Monday's packer bids were $63.00, with asking prices $65.00-$66.00.</p>
<p>Note - all cattle price based on hot weights FOB the feedlot after a four percent shrink.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
